# Dockerfile.dockerignore — context allowlist for the adjacent
# Dockerfile (BuildKit reads the `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore`
# sitting next to the Dockerfile in preference to a repo-root
# .dockerignore). The build context is the REPO ROOT, but the image
# only COPYs the two uv cache-pre-warm inputs — allowlisting them
# keeps the context transfer tiny and the build hermetic.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
